              <mxPoint x="1342" y="651.306" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="user-stories-title" value="USER STORIES - minimal effort GitHub connection" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#18181b;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="210" width="1050" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-story-1" value="US01 - Connect GitHub&#10;&#10;As a user, I want to choose Add connection and sign in with GitHub, so I can connect my account without registering an App or entering App IDs, client secrets, callbacks or tokens.&#10;&#10;Laomedo does the work: Laomedo opens GitHub, handles the return, verifies the account and saves the connection after the required approvals." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="310" width="1050" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-story-2" value="US02 - Choose repository access&#10;&#10;As a user, I want to choose which repositories Laomedo may read, so I stay in control of access.&#10;&#10;Laomedo does the work: Laomedo discovers available repositories and presents clear choices. I make the required access decisions; I do not copy repository IDs or repeat equivalent choices unnecessarily." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="595" width="1050" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-story-3" value="US03 - Use a saved connection&#10;&#10;As a user, I want to select a saved GitHub connection and use its permitted repositories, so I do not have to sign in or configure it again each time.&#10;&#10;Laomedo does the work: Laomedo remembers the account and consent, checks current access, and renews credentials automatically when supported." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="880" width="1050" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-story-4" value="US04 - Add another account&#10;&#10;As a user, I want to add another GitHub account through the same Add connection flow, so I can use multiple accounts without disturbing existing connections.&#10;&#10;Laomedo does the work: Laomedo manages each connection separately and shows which account and repositories belong to it. Duplicate-account handling remains an open decision." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="1165" width="1050" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-story-5" value="US05 - Recover access&#10;&#10;As a user, I want a clear explanation and the appropriate recovery action when access fails, so I can continue with minimal effort.&#10;&#10;Laomedo does the work: Laomedo preserves my selections and performs safe automatic recovery where possible. An offline check does not force a new login. It asks me to authorize again only when needed, for the correct saved account." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="1450" width="1050" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-story-6" value="US06 - Disconnect an account&#10;&#10;As a user, I want to disconnect a selected GitHub connection, so Laomedo stops using its access.&#10;&#10;Laomedo does the work: Laomedo blocks further private reads, clears private views and removes its stored credentials. It reports incomplete cleanup honestly and does not claim to revoke GitHub consent." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="1735" width="1050" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="user-stories-responsibility" value="SHARED RULE&#10;&#10;The user only makes identity, authorization and repository-access decisions that cannot appropriately be automated. Laomedo handles integration provisioning, navigation, verification, secure credential storage, renewal and connection state.&#10;&#10;Normal GitHub sign-in must not require the user to register an App or supply App credentials. A personal access token is an optional advanced alternative under Add connection, not a prerequisite.&#10;&#10;These stories record the owner's intended experience. Secure provisioning architecture remains to be resolved; this is not a claim that it is implemented. Existing graph/screens are unchanged and may need later alignment." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#93c5fd;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4350" y="2050" width="1050" height="390" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-gallery-title" value="SCREEN GALLERY - one state per viewport" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=30;fontColor=#18181b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="3580" width="3900" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-gallery-note" value="White backgrounds, 8 px spacing rhythm, 44 px actions. Identifiers match the graph; annotations stay outside the product UI." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#52525b;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="3635" width="3900" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-id" value="A / Saved GitHub connections" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#1d4ed8;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="3688" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-viewport" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;fillColor=#f8fafc;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="3730" width="1200" height="760" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-brand" value="Laomedo" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#52525b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="3752" width="280" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-caption" value="Connected list. Reauthorization is offered only for the account that needs it; ready accounts keep a quiet management action." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#52525b;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="4514" width="1192" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-content" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="106" y="3828" width="1088" height="576" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-title" value="GitHub connections" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#18181b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="3862" width="690" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-description" value="Manage the GitHub accounts Laomedo can use." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#71717a;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="3918" width="720" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-add" value="+ Add connection" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;fillColor=#18181b;strokeColor=#18181b;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="958" y="3868" width="204" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-list-label" value="CONNECTED ACCOUNTS" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#71717a;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="3990" width="700" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-avatar0" value="A" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="4050" width="48" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-account0" value="@amadou" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18181b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="4042" width="420" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-repositories0" value="2 repositories - my-skills, private-specs" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#71717a;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="4080" width="500" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-state0" value="Connected" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#15803d;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="766" y="4058" width="174" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-view0" value="View connection" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="4052" width="192" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-separator0" value="" style="fillColor=#e4e4e7;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="4144" width="1024" height="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-avatar1" value="W" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="4180" width="48" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-account1" value="@work-account" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18181b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="4172" width="420" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-repositories1" value="1 repository - team/skills" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#71717a;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="4210" width="500" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-state1" value="Sign-in required" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#92400e;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="766" y="4188" width="174" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-view1" value="Sign in again" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="4182" width="192" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a-separator1" value="" style="fillColor=#e4e4e7;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="4274" width="1024" height="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-id" value="M / GitHub sign-in in progress" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#1d4ed8;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="3688" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-viewport" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;fillColor=#f8fafc;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="3730" width="1200" height="760" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-brand" value="Laomedo" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#52525b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1432" y="3752" width="280" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-caption" value="Add opens GitHub automatically. This is the return/waiting view; Open GitHub is a fallback, not another mandatory click." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#52525b;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1404" y="4514" width="1192" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-panel" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710" y="3870" width="580" height="488" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-progress" value="" style="fillColor=#18181b;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1750" y="3912" width="64" height="4" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-title" value="Continue on GitHub" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#18181b;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1750" y="3950" width="500" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-copy" value="We opened GitHub to finish connecting your account.&#10;Return here after you authorize access." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#71717a;fontStyle=0;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1750" y="4016" width="500" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-open" value="Open GitHub" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4e4e7;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=15;fillColor=#18181b;strokeColor=#18181b;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1750" y="4124" width="500" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m-help" value="If GitHub did not open, use the button above." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#18181b;fontSize=16;spacin